---
import DashboardCard from "./dashboard/DashboardCard.astro";
---
<DashboardCard>
  <h2 class="card-title">Node-RED MQTT bridge</h2>
  <p class="card-subtitle mb-4">
    Import a flow to mirror Mosquitto readings (and optional door state) to ThermalTrace over HTTPS.
  </p>
  <ol class="text-sm space-y-2 mb-4">
    <li>Create a push device under <a class="text-link" href="/dashboard/temperature">Devices</a> and copy the ingest key.</li>
    <li>In Node-RED: Menu → Import → paste URL or upload JSON.</li>
    <li>Set env <code class="text-xs">THERMALTRACE_INGEST_KEY</code> (or edit the function node).</li>
    <li>Point the MQTT nodes at your broker; deploy and watch for HTTP 200 on the debug node.</li>
  </ol>
  <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 mb-4">
    <a class="btn-secondary" href="/nodered/mqtt-to-thermaltrace.json" download>
      Download flow JSON
    </a>
    <a class="btn-ghost" href="https://doodersrage.github.io/thermaltrace/integrations/mqtt-bridge">
      Developer docs
    </a>
    <a class="btn-ghost" href="/integrations/node-red">
      Full Node-RED guide
    </a>
  </div>
  <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-muted)] mb-0">
    Includes rate limiting (1 POST/min) and an optional door-sensor tab. Pair with
    <a class="text-link" href="/about/garage-door-cold-playbook">door + cold alerts</a>.
  </p>
</DashboardCard>
